  "_note": "JF-001 Rev 3.0 F-14 / SEC 8.3 — shipped default adapter config for NextMove Autofill (JobFill). This file is DATA, never code: it is Zod-validated against remoteAdapterConfigSchema (@repo/types/ExtensionTypes) and semver-gated before the CDN copy at apps/web/public/extension/adapters.json may replace it, which is what makes remote selector fixes MV3-legal. Layer keys are 'generic' (inherited by every adapter), the AtsId, and optionally '<atsId>:<tenant>' — Workday uses 'workday:<tenant-slug>' for per-tenant variance (SEC 6.5). Within fieldMap an empty value deletes the selector; selector LISTS are unioned with the higher-authority entry first. submitSelectors is union-only by construction: INV-1 means these controls are located and highlighted, never filled and never clicked. modelBudgets are APPROXIMATE, config-driven soft ceilings — Google revises free-tier limits without notice (SEC 5.2).",

